<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Hors ligne — {{ site_name }}</title>
    {# Deliberately NOT extending base.html.twig: that template pulls in
       per-request dynamic globals (menus, current_user_*, config_mode,
       cookie_consent_given) built from the DB/session at render time —
       this page is precached once by the service worker and can be
       served back much later with no network at all, so nothing dynamic
       or personal must ever end up baked into that cached snapshot. Only
       already-precached assets are linked (app.css, Bootstrap Icons —
       see APP_SHELL_BASE_URLS in public/sw.js), and offline-page.js is a
       plain external script: no inline handler, no CSP nonce, since a
       nonce baked into a precached response would go stale the moment
       the server issues a new one on the next request. #}
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('/assets/vendor/bootstrap/css/bootstrap.min.css') }}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('/assets/vendor/bootstrap-icons/bootstrap-icons.min.css') }}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('/assets/css/app.css') }}">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center text-center" style="min-height:100vh; padding:2rem;">
        <i class="bi bi-wifi-off" style="font-size:3rem;" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h1 class="h4 mt-3">Pas de connexion</h1>
        <p class="text-body-secondary">
            Cette page n'est pas disponible hors ligne. Vérifiez votre connexion puis réessayez.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row gap-2 mt-2">
            <button type="button" id="offline-retry-btn" class="btn btn-primary">Réessayer</button>
            <button type="button" id="offline-back-btn" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Retour</button>
            <a href="/" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Accueil</a>
        </div>
    </div>
    <script src="{{ asset('/assets/js/offline-page.js') }}"></script>
</body>
</html>
